# Local deploy bundle — rebuilt by `npm run build` + zip, never source of truth.
theroach-upload.zip

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THE CLIENT'S PRIVATE PRICELIST — NEVER COMMIT
#
# TheRoachPricing.png is material for private 1:1 WhatsApp conversations. The
# entire compliance architecture of this site rests on prices existing ONLY in
# that private channel: the CfPPA folds "advertise for sale" into "deal in"
# (up to 10 years). A public price list published under the client's name is the
# exact artefact we have spent this build keeping off the internet.
#
# GitHub is not private by default, repos get forked, and code search indexes
# blobs. Committing it once puts it in the history permanently — removing it
# later needs a history rewrite, and any fork keeps its copy.
#
# The build does NOT need it: `npm run images` allowlists sources explicitly and
# has never touched this file, and scripts/guard-pricing.mjs fails the build if
# it ever appears in public/ or out/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logoassets/TheRoachPricing.png
logoassets/*[Pp]ricing*
logoassets/*[Pp]rice*

# Superseded video sources (~6.7MB). roachsmokejoint.mp4 is the live one; these
# are kept locally but not worth carrying in git history.
logoassets/theroach.mp4
logoassets/roachjoint.mp4

# Generated from content/blog/uploads by scripts/optimise-blog-media.mjs
public/img/blog/

# Server secrets (Decap OAuth app credentials live in .env on the box)
.env

# CMS rebuild signal, written by the journal desk container
.rebuild-requested
